                              Description

        "Supported" here means the engine evaluates the restraint and
includes it in the energy and the forces.  It does not mean the whole
CHARMM command is available: several engines take only part of a restraint
type, and those limits are given per engine below.

The survey covers restraint energy terms as named in source/energy/energym.F90.
Constraints that remove degrees of freedom (SHAKE, CONS FIX) are a different
mechanism and are not covered here.


