                      How to re-derive this table

        This table goes stale the moment an engine gains a restraint, so
each column has one place to look:

  OpenMM   setup_restraints and mask_eterms in
           source/openmm/omm_restraint.F90
  BLaDE    the blade_add_* calls in source/blade_api/blade.F90
  DOMDEC   auxdata_kernel and read_from_auxdata in
           source/energy/energy_util.F90, which must agree with each other
  CPU      source/energy/energym.F90 for the term list
